   279	/**
   280	 * @brief Initializes the AUDIO handle structure with default values.
   281	 *
   282	 *        This function initializes all fields of the AUDIO handle structure to
   283	 * their default values. It prepares the handle for subsequent initialization
   284	 * and usage.
   285	 *
   286	 * @param[in,out] haudio Pointer to AUDIO handle structure to initialize
   287	 *
   288	 * @note This function must be called before any other AUDIO functions.
   289	 *       The application must still set the samplebits, samplerate, and channel
